*.xccheckout

## compatibility with Xcode 3 and earlier (ignoring not specific Mac OS X version)
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3

## Other
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
*.xcuserstate
*.xcstate

